    "description": "Read one price quote: ISSUED or EXPIRED at this instant (a quote past its expiresAt is EXPIRED whether or not the policy stored it yet), the cart it priced, its lines (unit price and line total), the delivery charge per shipment group, tax, total, the price, charge schedule and tax table versions it used, and issuedAt and expiresAt. Amounts are minor units of the quote currency. Read-only: it never issues a quote; an unknown id fails with not-found.",
